config OXP_WMI
	tristate "OneXPlayer G3E OxpWMI EC"
	depends on ACPI_WMI
	depends on HWMON
	depends on DMI
	help
	  WMI client for OneXPlayer Intel Arc G3 Extreme (G3E) handhelds
	  that use SuRwECRegInterface (ecAccessType=2).

	  Talks to GUID 43B5A593-AD62-4257-8546-91B0797BEC1B the same way
	  msi-wmi-platform talks to the MSI Claw GUID: wmidev_evaluate_method
	  plus a driver mutex. Exposes fan/PWM/CPU temp via hwmon and
	  charge limit / bypass via sysfs.

	  Do not enable this on AMD / WinRing0 boards (oxpec).

	  If unsure, say N.
